id: last-resort
name: Last Resort
order: 3
category: body
importance: secondary
description: >
  No matter the situation, no matter how grim it looks, an Earthling can dig deep and draw out an unexpected wellspring of power.
text: >
  Last Resort (Body): No matter the situation, no matter how grim it looks, an Earthling can dig deep and draw out an unexpected wellspring of power.
  (1)-[Passive]: If your Capacity is 0 when you roll the Wound Roll for a Signature Technique, increase the Wound Roll by 2(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: When you use the Signature Technique Maneuver to use a Signature Technique while you are below the Injured Health Threshold, you do not have to pay the Ki Point Cost for that instance of the Signature Technique.
  (3)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Encounter]: Double the bonus from the first effect of Earthling Resolve until the end of your next turn.

---

[passive]
# (1) Read as the Wound Roll is made - no Capacity left then - on a Signature Technique's (chat.mjs twoWorldsWoundParts).
wound.signatureNoCapacity += 2(T);
# (2) A box at the Signature Technique's declaration, Injured or Critical, once an Encounter: its Ki Point Cost not paid -
# a Ki Wager still is (use-maneuver.mjs askTechniqueDeclaration, maneuvers.mjs maneuverKiCost).
allow signature.lastResort;

# (3) The Power Up Maneuver used: Last Resort (a mark) - Earthling Resolve's 1(T) a Threshold once more - till the end of
# your next turn. A box in the Power Up's window, as every effect answering it - no Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/power, 1/encounter, effect 3]
gain(last-resort-mark);
expires(last-resort-mark, next-turn);
